# Product Dataset – Data Cleaning and Transformation

## Project Overview
This project focuses on cleaning and transforming a product dataset using Microsoft Excel.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel

## Tasks Performed
1. Handled missing values.
2. Corrected spelling mistakes using Find and Replace.
3. Removed duplicate records.
4. Split and merged columns.
5. Applied conditional formatting.

## Final Result
- Removed 3 duplicate records.
- Retained 31 unique records.
- Corrected inconsistent text.
- Improved dataset quality and readability.

## Conclusion
The dataset was cleaned and organized using Excel features, making it ready for further data analysis.
